#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""vpn-tui: a terminal front-end for NetworkManager's OpenVPN profiles.

It covers the menu of the OpenVPN GUI tray icon on Windows: Connect,
Disconnect, Reconnect, Show Status, View Log, Edit Config, Change / Clear
Saved Password, Import (file or URL) and Settings. Everything goes through
nmcli, so the bar widget and this TUI always agree about state.

  vpn-tui                     open the TUI
  vpn-tui --auth NAME         open it at the username/password prompt
  vpn-tui --connect NAME      connect without a UI (used by "Connect at login")
  vpn-tui --disconnect NAME

https://github.com/Amiral-Code/vpn-tui · MIT license
"""
